Krzysztof wrote:
> what it mean to 'genocide'

After genociding a certain type (or class) of monsters, monsters of the
type (or class) won't appear in the game anymore. You can genocide types
of monsters by reading an uncursed scroll of genocide or sitting on a
throne. You can genocide classes of monsters by reading a blessed scroll
of genocide.
Reading a cursed scroll of genocide will "reverse-genocide" the type of
monsters you specify. That means instead of being wiped out, some of the
specified types of monsters will appear right next to you.


